{
 "uid": "ab-tests",
 "title": "Card Support - A/B tests",
 "description": "Agent model config A/B (risk-agent vs risk-agent-b) and LLM version A/B (Qwen3-8B local vs Qwen3.8-27B on Groq), side by side.",
 "tags": [
  "card-support",
  "layer3"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "time": {
  "from": "now-1h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "refresh": "30s",
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 100,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "How these A/B tests work",
   "gridPos": {
    "w": 24,
    "h": 4,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Agent model config** (rubric C52): the gateway sends 50 % of the coordinator's calls to `risk-agent` to its copy `risk-agent-b`, which only differs by its ModelConfig (`agents/chart/values-data-agents.yaml`, `abTests`). **LLM version** (C53): route `llm` sends 80 % of all model calls to Qwen3-8B on llama.cpp (llm-d) and 20 % to Qwen3.8-27B on Groq (`infra/k8s/agentgateway.yaml`). Quality of each side: `agents/eval/run_eval.py` (pinned with headers `x-agent-variant` / `x-llm-variant`). See docs/ab_testing.md."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 101,
   "type": "row",
   "title": "Agent model config: risk-agent A vs B",
   "gridPos": {
    "w": 24,
    "h": 1,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 4
   },
   "collapsed": false,
   "panels": []
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "A2A calls per minute",
   "description": "Calls the gateway routed to each variant.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "w": 8,
    "h": 8,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 5
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "sum(rate(agentgateway_requests_total{backend=\"agentgateway-system/agent-risk-agent\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
     "legendFormat": "A: risk-agent (global config)",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "sum(rate(agentgateway_requests_total{backend=\"agentgateway-system/agent-risk-agent-b\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
     "legendFormat": "B: risk-agent-b (temperature 0.2, max 512 tokens)",
     "refId": "B"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "custom": {
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "pointSize": 8,
      "showPoints": "auto"
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "A: risk-agent (global config)"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#2a78d6"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "B: risk-agent-b (temperature 0.2, max 512 tokens)"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#eb6834"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom",
     "showLegend": true
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "none"
    }
   }
  },
